    "Your Bluesky account is moved to {server}. This cannot be undone from here." : "Sinu Bluesky konto kolitakse serverisse {server}. Seda ei saa siit tagasi võtta.",
    "You have no recovery phrase: afterwards only {server} controls your Bluesky account." : "Sul ei ole taastefraasi: pärast haldab sinu Bluesky kontot ainult {server}.",
