    "_%n post you wrote here was taken off Bluesky by the move. It can be published again from your moved account._::_%n posts you wrote here were taken off Bluesky by the move. They can be published again from your moved account._" : ["%n siin kirjutatud postitus eemaldati kolimisega Blueskyst. Selle saab sinu kolitud kontolt uuesti avaldada.","%n siin kirjutatud postitust eemaldati kolimisega Blueskyst. Need saab sinu kolitud kontolt uuesti avaldada."],
