    "Hidden: no likes, dislikes, boosts or replies are counted for you — on your posts, on anybody else's, and in your phone apps — and other people's profiles show no follower number. Who liked a post is still there to look at, and so is your own follower count." : "Peidetud: sinu jaoks ei loendata meeldimisi, mittemeeldimisi, jagamisi ega vastuseid – ei sinu postitustel, ei teiste omadel ega sinu telefonirakendustes – ja teiste profiilidel pole jälgijate arvu näha. Kellele postitus meeldis, on endiselt näha, nagu ka sinu enda jälgijate arv.",
