    "_%n view_::_%n views_" : ["%n vaatamine","%n vaatamist"],
    "Could not delete your account" : "Sinu kontot ei õnnestunud kustutada",
    "Everything you posted from here is deleted, your followers and the people you follow are let go, and every server that knew this account is told it is gone. It cannot be undone, and there is no way to get any of it back afterwards — take an archive from the Export button above first if you might want one." : "Kõik, mida siit postitasid, kustutatakse, sinu jälgijad ja sinu jälgitavad lastakse lahti ning igale serverile, mis seda kontot tundis, öeldakse, et seda enam pole. Seda ei saa tagasi võtta ja hiljem pole võimalik midagi sellest tagasi saada — kui võid arhiivi soovida, tee see enne ülaloleva nupuga Ekspordi.",
    "Your account on this server was made for Aloha Social, so it is deleted too, and you are signed out. The handle you are deleting is held for an hour so that nobody else can take it the moment you let it go." : "Sinu konto selles serveris loodi Aloha Sociali jaoks, seega kustutatakse ka see ja sind logitakse välja. Kustutatavat kasutajanime hoitakse tund aega reserveerituna, et keegi teine ei saaks seda kohe võtta, kui sa sellest loobud.",
    "Your Nextcloud account is not touched: you stay signed in to everything else, and you can make a new Aloha Social account straight away. The handle you are deleting is held for an hour so that nobody else can take it the moment you let it go, so a new account needs a different one." : "Sinu Nextcloudi kontot see ei puuduta: jääd kõigesse muusse sisselogituks ja saad kohe uue Aloha Sociali konto luua. Kustutatavat kasutajanime hoitakse tund aega reserveerituna, et keegi teine ei saaks seda kohe võtta, kui sa sellest loobud, seega vajab uus konto teist kasutajanime.",
    "A post that already reached somebody else's server is deleted by asking that server to delete it. Almost all of them do; none of them can be made to." : "Postitus, mis on juba jõudnud kellegi teise serverisse, kustutatakse, paludes sellel serveril see kustutada. Peaaegu kõik teevad seda; ühtegi neist ei saa selleks sundida.",
    "Delete my Aloha Social account" : "Kustuta minu Aloha Sociali konto",
    "Type {handle} to confirm that this is the account you mean." : "Sisesta {handle}, et kinnitada, et see on konto, mida mõtled.",
    "The handle of the account to delete" : "Kustutatava konto kasutajanimi",
