    "You have no lists yet. Make one under Settings, then come back here to put people in it." : "Sul pole veel loendeid. Loo üks seadetes ja tule siis siia tagasi, et inimesi sinna lisada.",
    "Tick a list to put them in it. Lists your Nextcloud groups give you are not here: the group decides who is in those." : "Märgi loend, et nad sinna lisada. Sinu Nextcloudi gruppidest tulevaid loendeid siin pole: nendes olijad otsustab grupp.",
    "The list {list} has been created" : "Loend {list} on loodud",
