    "You have no lists yet. A list is a few of the people you follow, read as a timeline of their own." : "Sul pole veel loendeid. Loend on mõni sinu jälgitavatest inimestest, keda loed eraldi ajajoonena.",
    "Name of the list" : "Loendi nimi",
