    "Service DID" : "Teenuse DID",
    "One address per line. A relay is what carries this server's posts to the Bluesky apps; without one, a post written here is published and seen by nobody." : "Üks aadress rea kohta. Relee viib selle serveri postitused Bluesky rakendusteni; ilma selleta avaldatakse siin kirjutatud postitus, kuid keegi ei näe seda.",
