    "External users then set up an authenticator app or a security key when they first log in. This is Nextcloud's own setting, the same as in Administration → Security." : "Välised kasutajad seadistavad siis esimesel sisselogimisel autentimisrakenduse või turvavõtme. See on Nextcloudi enda seade, sama mis jaotises Haldus → Turvalisus.",
