    "All starter packs" : "Kõik stardipakid",
    "Their server did not answer. Often it is only busy for a moment. If this Nextcloud cannot be reached from the internet, some servers never answer it." : "Nende server ei vastanud. Sageli on see vaid hetkeks hõivatud. Kui see Nextcloud pole internetist kättesaadav, ei vasta mõned serverid sellele kunagi.",
    "No starter packs" : "Stardipakke pole",
    "Your island and its neighbours" : "Sinu saar ja selle naabrid",
    "Every server in the fediverse is an island. Following somebody on another one opens a canoe route to it, and their posts travel to you along that route." : "Iga Fediverse'i server on saar. Kellegi jälgimine teisel saarel avab sinna kanuutee ja tema postitused rändavad seda teed mööda sinuni.",
    "Search the fediverse" : "Otsi Fediverse'ist",
    "Names and handles in public directories, including people on servers this one has never met. Somebody who is not listed is found by their full handle, like @someone@example.org or @someone.example.com, in the search at the top of the sidebar." : "Nimed ja kasutajanimed avalikes kataloogides, sealhulgas inimesed serverites, mida see server pole kunagi kohanud. Kellegi, keda pole loendis, leiab tema täieliku kasutajanimega, näiteks @someone@example.org või @someone.example.com, külgriba ülaosas olevast otsingust.",
    "Names and handles in public directories, including people on servers this one has never met. Somebody who is not listed is found by their full handle, like @someone@example.org, in the search at the top of the sidebar." : "Nimed ja kasutajanimed avalikes kataloogides, sealhulgas inimesed serverites, mida see server pole kunagi kohanud. Kellegi, keda pole loendis, leiab tema täieliku kasutajanimega, näiteks @someone@example.org, külgriba ülaosas olevast otsingust.",
    "Because of who you follow" : "Sinu jälgitavate põhjal",
    "The people you follow follow other people. This asks their servers who, and puts the ones several of them share first." : "Inimesed, keda jälgid, jälgivad teisi inimesi. See küsib nende serveritelt, keda, ja paneb ettepoole need, keda mitu neist jagavad.",
    "Suggested on Bluesky" : "Soovitatud Blueskys",
    "People Bluesky suggests to you, from who you follow there. Follow them here like anybody else." : "Inimesed, keda Bluesky sulle soovitab sinu sealsete jälgitavate põhjal. Jälgi neid siin nagu kõiki teisi.",
    "People this server knows" : "Inimesed, keda see server tunneb",
    "Accounts on this Nextcloud, and the ones it has met through the people here." : "Selle Nextcloudi kontod ja need, keda see on siinsete inimeste kaudu kohanud.",
    "On your Nextcloud" : "Sinu Nextcloudis",
    "Nobody here yet" : "Siin pole veel kedagi",
    "Accounts this server has met will appear here. Until it has met any, the search above asks other servers’ directories instead." : "Siia ilmuvad kontod, mida see server on kohanud. Kuni ta pole kedagi kohanud, küsib ülalolev otsing hoopis teiste serverite katalooge.",
    "Failed to load follow requests" : "Jälgimistaotluste laadimine ebaõnnestus",
    "Failed to accept the follow request" : "Jälgimistaotluse kinnitamine ebaõnnestus",
