    "Authorized" : "Autoriseeritud",
    "Paste this code into {appDisplayName} to finish signing in. It can be used once, and only by the application that asked for it." : "Sisselogimise lõpetamiseks kleebi see kood rakendusse {appDisplayName}. Seda saab kasutada üks kord ja ainult rakendus, mis seda küsis.",
