    "This step is needed as the user is probably not registered on the same server as you are. We will redirect you to your homeserver to follow this account." : "See samm on vajalik, sest kasutaja pole tõenäoliselt registreeritud samas serveris kui sina. Suuname sind selle konto jälgimiseks sinu koduserverisse.",
