    "Whose videos" : "Kelle videod",
    "These figures are for the fediverse only. {networks} publishes no count of its accounts that could be quoted here, so it is not included." : "Need arvud on ainult Fediverse'i kohta. {networks} ei avalda oma kontode arvu, mida siin tsiteerida saaks, seega pole see kaasatud.",
    "Translated by {provider}" : "Tõlkinud {provider}",
    "One step is left, on your old server: tell it to move your followers here. On Mastodon that is Preferences → Account → Move to a different account; enter {handle} there." : "Jäänud on üks samm sinu vanas serveris: palu sellel kolida sinu jälgijad siia. Mastodonis on see Eelistused → Konto → Koli teisele kontole; sisesta sinna {handle}.",
    "The latest change was made on {date}. Until {until}, it can still be undone by: {keys}." : "Viimane muudatus tehti {date}. Kuni {until} saavad selle veel tagasi võtta: {keys}.",
