    "That server address does not look right. Check it and try again." : "See serveri aadress ei tundu õige. Kontrolli seda ja proovi uuesti.",
    "That server cannot be reached from the internet. Check the address and try again." : "See server pole internetist kättesaadav. Kontrolli aadressi ja proovi uuesti.",
    "The other server could not be reached. Check the address, or try again later." : "Teist serverit ei õnnestunud tabada. Kontrolli aadressi või proovi hiljem uuesti.",
    "That address is not a server Bluesky accounts can live on. Check it and try again." : "See aadress ei ole server, kus Bluesky kontod saavad asuda. Kontrolli seda ja proovi uuesti.",
    "The other server refused a step of the move. Try again; if it happens again, the details say which step." : "Teine server keeldus kolimise ühest sammust. Proovi uuesti; kui see kordub, ütlevad üksikasjad, milline samm.",
    "The sign-in on the other server ran out. Try again." : "Sisselogimine teises serveris aegus. Proovi uuesti.",
    "That server does not give out handles like this one. Pick a handle that ends in one of its domains; the details name them." : "See server ei jaga selliseid kasutajanimesid. Vali kasutajanimi, mis lõpeb ühega selle domeenidest; üksikasjad nimetavad need.",
    "That handle is taken on the other server. Pick another one." : "See kasutajanimi on teises serveris võetud. Vali teine.",
    "That server needs an invite code. Ask the people who run it for one and enter it." : "See server nõuab kutsekoodi. Küsi seda serveri haldajatelt ja sisesta see.",
    "The other server did not accept the invite code. Check it and try again." : "Teine server ei aktsepteerinud kutsekoodi. Kontrolli seda ja proovi uuesti.",
    "The other server did not accept that password. Pick a longer one." : "Teine server ei aktsepteerinud seda parooli. Vali pikem.",
    "There were too many tries for now. Wait a while and try again." : "Praegu oli liiga palju katseid. Oota natuke ja proovi uuesti.",
    "The other server did not make the account. The details say why." : "Teine server ei loonud kontot. Üksikasjad ütlevad, miks.",
    "This server cannot open its keys right now. Ask your administrator about it." : "See server ei saa praegu oma võtmeid avada. Küsi selle kohta oma administraatorilt.",
    "The directory that keeps Bluesky identifiers did not answer. Try again later." : "Bluesky identifikaatoreid hoidev kataloog ei vastanud. Proovi hiljem uuesti.",
    "The archive could not be made. Try again later." : "Arhiivi ei õnnestunud luua. Proovi hiljem uuesti.",
    "The recovery tool is not available on this server. Ask your administrator about it." : "Taastetööriist pole selles serveris saadaval. Küsi selle kohta oma administraatorilt.",
    "The directory that keeps Bluesky identifiers refused the change. Try again; if it happens again, the details say why." : "Bluesky identifikaatoreid hoidev kataloog keeldus muudatusest. Proovi uuesti; kui see kordub, ütlevad üksikasjad, miks.",
    "You have no recovery phrase. Make one first, or confirm that only the new server will control your account." : "Sul pole taastefraasi. Loo see kõigepealt või kinnita, et sinu kontot haldab ainult uus server.",
    "There is no move to call off. Reload the page to see where it stands." : "Pole kolimist, mida tühistada. Laadi leht uuesti, et näha, kus see seisab.",
    "Your account is being pointed at the new server right now. Wait a moment: the move then goes on or stops." : "Sinu kontot suunatakse praegu uuele serverile. Oota hetk: kolimine seejärel jätkub või peatub.",
    "Your account already points at the new server, so the move can no longer be called off. Use \"Try again\" to finish it." : "Sinu konto osutab juba uuele serverile, seega ei saa kolimist enam tühistada. Selle lõpetamiseks kasuta nuppu „Proovi uuesti“.",
