    "That is not a domain name. Type a domain you own, such as example.com." : "See ei ole domeeninimi. Sisesta domeen, mis sulle kuulub, näiteks example.com.",
    "Handles under this server's own address are given out by the server. Use a domain of your own." : "Selle serveri enda aadressi all olevad kasutajanimed jagab server. Kasuta oma domeeni.",
    "Another account here already uses that domain as its handle. Use another domain." : "Teine siinne konto kasutab seda domeeni juba oma kasutajanimena. Kasuta teist domeeni.",
    "That domain does not point at your account yet. Add the record shown below, wait a few minutes for it to spread, and try again." : "See domeen ei osuta veel sinu kontole. Lisa allpool näidatud kirje, oota paar minutit, kuni see levib, ja proovi uuesti.",
    "Give the app password a name of up to 64 characters." : "Anna rakenduse paroolile kuni 64 märgi pikkune nimi.",
