    "That file is not an archive this page can read. Pick the zip file the export made." : "See fail ei ole arhiiv, mida see leht lugeda oskab. Vali ekspordi loodud zip-fail.",
    "That archive holds no account of this app. Pick the zip file the export made." : "Selles arhiivis pole selle rakenduse kontot. Vali ekspordi loodud zip-fail.",
    "That is under way already. See how far it got on the list of imports." : "See on juba pooleli. Vaata importide loendist, kui kaugele see on jõudnud.",
