    "There is no such list to download." : "Sellist allalaaditavat loendit pole.",
    "Your account is not set up yet. Open Aloha Social and choose your username to set it up, then try again." : "Sinu konto pole veel seadistatud. Ava Aloha Social ja vali selle seadistamiseks oma kasutajanimi, seejärel proovi uuesti.",
    "That is not an account address. Type it like @you@example.social." : "See ei ole konto aadress. Sisesta see kujul @sina@example.social.",
    "No account answers to that address. Check it and try again." : "Sellele aadressile ei vasta ükski konto. Kontrolli seda ja proovi uuesti.",
    "That server only answers servers it can check, and it could not check this one. Ask your administrator to make this server reachable from the internet." : "See server vastab ainult serveritele, mida ta saab kontrollida, ja seda ei õnnestunud tal kontrollida. Palu oma administraatoril teha see server internetist kättesaadavaks.",
    "That is this account itself. Type the address of your other account." : "See on see sama konto. Sisesta oma teise konto aadress.",
    "Type your own handle to confirm the move. The details show it." : "Kolimise kinnitamiseks sisesta oma kasutajanimi. Üksikasjad näitavad seda.",
