    "An account cannot move onto itself. Type the address of your new account." : "Konto ei saa iseendasse kolida. Sisesta oma uue konto aadress.",
    "Your new account does not name this one yet. Add this account as an alias on the new account first, then try again." : "Sinu uus konto ei nimeta veel seda kontot. Lisa see konto kõigepealt uuel kontol aliaseks ja proovi siis uuesti.",
    "The last step cannot be done from here for that server. Finish the move there, with its own button." : "Selle serveri puhul ei saa viimast sammu siit teha. Lõpeta kolimine seal selle enda nupuga.",
    "The old server did not let this one finish the move. Try again later, or finish the move there." : "Vana server ei lasknud sellel serveril kolimist lõpetada. Proovi hiljem uuesti või lõpeta kolimine seal.",
    "That is not a video address. Copy the address of the video page and try again." : "See ei ole video aadress. Kopeeri videolehe aadress ja proovi uuesti.",
